  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tax Advisory Service for Investment components</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is to obtain expert tax advice required for FCDO India to support private sector investments (Development Capital) implemented in FCDO supported programmes in India. Under this project, Tax advice is provided to Investment programmes which invests in sectors that promote sustainable economic development, help reduce poverty and contribute towards achievement of India&#x2019;s Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs).</narrative>
  </description>
